<title>BELGIUM: EU majority opposes 1,000 lira/mark in ERM.</title>
<headline>EU majority opposes 1,000 lira/mark in ERM.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A majority of European Union countries are against letting the Italian lira enter the Exchange Rate Mechanism at 1,000 lira to mark, an EU official said on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;There is a majority opposing a rate of 1,000&quot; he said, adding that Germany was leading the opposition. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
